# Keeps secrets, local data, tests, docs and deployment files out of the vault image build context
# (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md#build-the-image).
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next*
**/data
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.claude
e2e
docs
deploy
examples/demo
apps/vault/tests
apps/vault/vitest*.ts
packages/*/tests
compose.yaml
README.md
# The brand is mounted at runtime: it is not part of the image.
brands
**/.impeccable
